WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.304 --> 00:00:13.509
What art form is nine hundred years old and includes acrobatics, martial arts, and squeaky singing?

2
00:00:14.309 --> 00:00:16.591
If you guessed the Chinese opera, you're right!

3
00:00:17.371 --> 00:00:22.875
If you're wondering what the Chinese opera is like, and why the singers have squeaky voices, keep reading!

4
00:00:24.336 --> 00:00:27.618
If you were to attend the Chinese opera, this is what it would be like.

5
00:00:28.219 --> 00:00:30.060
First you would see an empty stage.

6
00:00:30.784 --> 00:00:35.808
The actors want people in the audience to use their imagination, so they use only a few stage

7
00:00:35.868 --> 00:00:41.732
decorations. The performers also need a lot of room on stage for their acrobatics and martial arts.

8
00:00:43.673 --> 00:00:45.414
Next you might see a mini orchestra.

9
00:00:45.995 --> 00:00:52.559
The orchestra is usually made up of string instruments like guitars, wind instruments like flutes, drums, and wooden

10
00:00:52.579 --> 00:00:58.543
clappers. These are used to make music as well as sound effects, like a horse galloping or a

11
00:00:58.603 --> 00:00:59.384
rooster crowing.

12
00:01:01.736 --> 00:01:03.798
Then you will see the actors come on stage.

13
00:01:04.719 --> 00:01:09.042
There are four groups of characters: Sheng, Dan, Jing, and Chou.

14
00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:13.546
Sheng are the men in the opera, such as an uncle or a little boy.

15
00:01:14.226 --> 00:01:17.729
Unlike the actors in the other three groups, they don't paint their faces.

16
00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:23.234
Dan are the women in the play, and they are the ones who sing with the squeaky voices.

17
00:01:23.854 --> 00:01:25.576
Jing are the warriors or demons.

18
00:01:26.276 --> 00:01:27.557
And Chou are the clowns.

19
00:01:28.398 --> 00:01:33.217
They wear white makeup on their noses and their job is to keep the audience laughing.

20
00:01:34.477 --> 00:01:37.358
So why do the Dan sing with squeaky voices?

21
00:01:38.118 --> 00:01:42.059
Even though the Dan are women, the actors playing them are almost always men.

22
00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:46.481
When a man pretends to have a woman's voice, it often sounds squeaky.

23
00:01:47.281 --> 00:01:53.003
Nine hundred years ago, the Chinese opera was performed outside, so the actors had to sing loudly.

24
00:01:54.383 --> 00:01:57.084
Their voices weren't supposed to sound pretty, just loud.

25
00:01:57.852 --> 00:02:01.094
It takes a lifetime of studying to be an actor in the Chinese opera.

26
00:02:01.615 --> 00:02:05.738
Historically, children were sold to the opera to begin training when they were young.

27
00:02:06.378 --> 00:02:09.380
Parents knew that the opera would give their children a good life.

28
00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:15.805
Even though the children were young, they would get up early every morning to begin their exercises, and

29
00:02:15.825 --> 00:02:17.426
they would practice all day long.

30
00:02:18.187 --> 00:02:24.171
One actor remembers having to do handstands on a chair for hours and practicing five thousand kicks and

31
00:02:24.231 --> 00:02:25.212
punches in one day.

32
00:02:25.996 --> 00:02:30.740
The children were forced to work very hard, but it made their bodies some of the strongest in

33
00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:36.565
China. One of the most famous stars of the Chinese opera is Jackie Chan.

34
00:02:37.186 --> 00:02:42.190
When he was six, his parents signed a ten-year contract so he could be trained in the opera.

35
00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:47.054
When Jackie Chan became an adult, the Chinese opera was not very popular anymore.

36
00:02:47.674 --> 00:02:51.998
So, Jackie Chan used what he had learned at the opera to become one of the best martial

37
00:02:52.078 --> 00:02:54.140
arts superstars in movie history.

38
00:02:54.988 --> 00:03:01.177
The Chinese opera is a lot more than beautiful costumes, amazing acrobatics, martial arts stunts, and stories.

39
00:03:01.938 --> 00:03:06.103
It is an art form that brings together the best cultural traditions of China.
